{"seq":20,"slug":"formal-methods","title":"形式化方法与验证","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 形式化方法与验证 简介\n\n形式化方法是利用数学逻辑和严格的形式语言来描述、设计和验证软件与硬件系统的一套方法论。在航空航天、金融交易、操作系统内核等对正确性要求极高的领域，形式化方法已经成为保障系统可靠性的重要手段。随着软件系统复杂度的持续增长，掌握形式化方法不仅是学术追求，更是工程实践中提升系统质量的有效途径。\n\n本知识库适合具有一定编程经验和离散数学基础的中高级开发者。你不需要精通数理逻辑，但对命题逻辑、谓词逻辑和集合论有基本了解将有助于理解后续内容。如果你正在从事分布式系统、嵌入式开发或安全关键软件的工作，这里的知识将直接应用于你的日常实践。\n\n全书分为四章，由浅入深地构建完整的知识体系。\n\n第一章**基础理论**介绍形式化方法的核心概念，包括形式化规约的定义方式、支撑规约的逻辑基础，以及状态机作为系统行为建模工具的原理与应用。\n\n第二章**模型检验**聚焦于自动化验证技术，讲解模型检验的基本原理、用于描述系统时序行为的时序逻辑，以及 SPIN 和 NuSMV 两款主流模型检验工具的使用方法。\n\n第三章**定理证明**转向交互式验证方法，介绍证明辅助工具的设计理念，深入探讨 Coq 和 Lean 两大证明助手的实际运用，并展示如何对程序进行严格的形式化验证。\n\n第四章**工业应用**将理论与实践相结合，介绍 TLA+ 和 Alloy 两种面向工程的形式化语言，并通过工业界的真实案例展示形式化方法在实际项目中的落地经验。\n\n推荐学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。先掌握基础理论以建立概念框架，再学习模型检验和定理证明两条互补的验证路径，最后通过工业应用章节将所学知识与实际工程场景相结合。如果你已有一定基础，也可以直接跳到感兴趣的章节，每章都保持了相对独立的叙述结构。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"formal-specification","title":"形式化规约","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/foundations/formal-specification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logic-foundations","title":"逻辑基础","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/foundations/logic-foundations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-machines","title":"状态机与形式化建模","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/foundations/state-machines"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"model-checking","title":"模型检验","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/model-checking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-checking-principles","title":"模型检测原理","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/model-checking/model-checking-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"temporal-logic","title":"时序逻辑","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/model-checking/temporal-logic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spin-and-nusmv","title":"SPIN 与 NuSMV","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/model-checking/spin-and-nusmv"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"theorem-proving","title":"定理证明","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/theorem-proving","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"proof-assistants","title":"证明助手","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/theorem-proving/proof-assistants"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coq-and-lean","title":"Coq 与 Lean","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/theorem-proving/coq-and-lean"},{"seq":3,"slug":"program-verification","title":"程序验证","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/theorem-proving/program-verification"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"industrial-application","title":"工业应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/industrial-application","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tla-plus","title":"TLA+ 形式化规约语言","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/industrial-application/tla-plus"},{"seq":2,"slug":"alloy","title":"Alloy 轻量形式化建模","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/industrial-application/alloy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"formal-methods-in-industry","title":"形式化方法的工业应用","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/industrial-application/formal-methods-in-industry"}]}]}